{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 813, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f5c2f16bf8e7f25ef374f0b2f1b2f1c781432f2ff3f0f1d8f9aef369f36df8b2f473f0eff0a5f29ef0a9f7d12f2ff0b3f0b48143f273f274f0af8148", "baseline_text": "쌍무를 움직이려면，//엄청난 영력이 필요하겠군…//홍란，괜찮아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "双武を動かすには、//すさまじい霊力が必要だな……//紅蘭、大丈夫か？", "pointer_offset": 680, "unit": "dialogue:63e949d2828f827f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 880, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f3a88143f273f274f0af81442f2ff0dbf9c2f2e4f8a4f0ad8144", "baseline_text": "응，괜찮아．//신경 쓰지 마．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うん、平気や。//気にせんといて。", "pointer_offset": 684, "unit": "dialogue:a7c1bdc46392ca85", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 913, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f7d12f2ff0b1f7d1f5c2f16bf8e7f8d4f94af154f8f1f267f14781432f2ff18efa63f184f461f8f1f0c6f0f7f14b8144", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨…//나…쌍무를 탈 수 있게 돼서，//정말 고맙게 생각해．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神はん……//ウチ……双武に乗れて、//ホンマに感謝してるんやで。", "pointer_offset": 688, "unit": "dialogue:c916b1fb9f75d4a8", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 978, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f163f94ef140f0b9f147f0f481432f2ff144f8e4f369f36df8b2f571f0f3f18df7d12f2ff0b1f8e7f1d1f386f94bf3ebf0a2f0b8fa61f263f0b2f1488144", "baseline_text": "화조 중에서도，//가장 영력이 낮은데…//나를 선택해 줬으니까 말이야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "花組の中でも、//一番霊力が低いのに……//選んでくれたんやもんな。", "pointer_offset": 692, "unit": "dialogue:9e5961b0bf8b9d9c", "prior_review": "사투리 보강"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1043, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f8e1f0c5f182f0c82f2ff2b2f8f1f298f0a4f8f4f271f272f29ef0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff36bf36cf8b6fa57f2aff0b8f261f7d1", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨의 발목을//잡게 될지도 모르겠지만…//열심히 할 테니까…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神はんの足を//ひっぱるかもしれへんけど……//がんばるさかい……", "pointer_offset": 696, "unit": "dialogue:4f6645e2bfe20df9", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1108, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0e72f2ff490f984f2bff0cff984f0c6f0f7f0a5f0b8f261f7d12f2ff3b2f8b9f154f8f1f94bf2658144", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨를//돕고 싶다고 생각하니까…//곁에 있게 해 줘．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神はんのこと、//助けたいと思てるさかい……//そばにおいといてな。", "pointer_offset": 700, "unit": "dialogue:4b79909bb7f6c9b0", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1175, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f0b3f0b4f7d1", "baseline_text": "홍란…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "紅蘭……", "pointer_offset": 704, "unit": "dialogue:d2c08771058b4911", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1184, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f8d8f0adf2c3f1d4f0a2f0a3f8f4f255f1cef14b8144", "baseline_text": "그 마음만으로도 충분해．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "その気持ちだけで十分だよ。", "pointer_offset": 708, "unit": "dialogue:927d8b782f7b1c90", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1211, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f14ff0e2f0a5f984f154f0c8f0f18144", "baseline_text": "기대하고 있을게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "期待しているよ。", "pointer_offset": 712, "unit": "dialogue:51aee4d0b5eeb1c2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1228, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f8d8f0adf2c3f1d4f0a2f0a3f8f4f255f1cef14b81442f2ff0b3f0b4f7d12f2ff27bf95cf2c8f960f154f0faf7d1", "baseline_text": "그 마음만으로도 충분해．//홍란…//계속 함께 있자…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "その気持ちだけで十分だよ。//紅蘭……//ずっと一緒にいような……", "pointer_offset": 716, "unit": "dialogue:25938ab9ddea9071", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1291, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f7d1", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神はん……", "pointer_offset": 720, "unit": "dialogue:c1d783172b16c519", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1304, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0b1f7d1f27bf95cf0c6f0f7f0ccf15a81442f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0e781432f2ff0f4f9d7f1e2f984f2bff0cff184f7d1", "baseline_text": "나…계속 생각했어．//오오가미 씨를，//도와 주고 싶다고…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ウチ……ずっと考えてたんや。//大神はんのこと、//助けてあげたいって……", "pointer_offset": 724, "unit": "dialogue:cd2634cf0a967125", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1375, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0c7f0b8f261f7d12f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247fa82f5c2f16bf8e7f8d4f94af154f15af14781432f2ff18efa63f14ff4dd8144", "baseline_text": "그러니까…//오오가미 씨랑 쌍무를 탈 수 있어서，//정말 기뻐．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "せやから……//大神はんと双武に乗れて、//ホンマにうれしい。", "pointer_offset": 728, "unit": "dialogue:3492013070ea63d2", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1434, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f8e1f369f36df0c8f7d12f2ff16bfba2f144f5b0f8f1f0bdf45ef7d1", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨의 영력을…//무척 가깝게 느껴…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神はんの霊力を……//すごく身近に感じる……", "pointer_offset": 732, "unit": "dialogue:ff82e9ab0bb20fd1", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1479, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0b1f0f4f7d1f0b3f0b4f0c82f2ff16bfba2f144f5b0f8f1f0bdf45e8144", "baseline_text": "나도…홍란을//무척 가깝게 느껴．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺も……紅蘭を//すごく身近に感じるよ。", "pointer_offset": 736, "unit": "dialogue:d09baa48b5ab5667", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1518, "capacity": 68, "raw_hex": "f0aff0a5f0a58143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf24781b82f2ff16ff8b2f183f984f154f0a2f0b881432f2ff144f5b0f8f1f0bdf45ef0a4f957f8f1f1f9f181f0a5f276f0af81b8", "baseline_text": "아하하，오오가미 씨∈//같이 타고 있으니，//가깝게 느껴지는 게 당연하잖아∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あはは、大神はん！//一緒に乗ってるんやさかい、//身近なんはあたりまえやん∈", "pointer_offset": 740, "unit": "dialogue:83f58f38790c7888", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1593, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0fa8143f15af947f1bdf25ef8c8f3a1f19cf18481432f2ff1bcf0b2f947f283f8c7f144f0fa8144", "baseline_text": "자，어서 싸움을 끝내고，//둘이서 놀러 가자．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さ、はやく戦いを終わらせて、//二人で遊びに行こうな。", "pointer_offset": 744, "unit": "dialogue:d9746ce0bece3157", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1646, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f7d1f2c9f2e9f15a81b82f2ff2d8f15cf0b2f1488143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf24781b8", "baseline_text": "…알았어∈//약속이야，오오가미 씨∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……了解や！//約束やで、大神はん∈", "pointer_offset": 748, "unit": "dialogue:7ccdb94629861f1b", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 2526, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f14ff0e2f0a5f984f154f15a81442f2ff484f99cf2658143f0b3f0b48144", "baseline_text": "기대하고 있어．//힘내 줘，홍란．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "期待しているよ。//しっかりとな、紅蘭。", "pointer_offset": 752, "unit": "dialogue:0ac5c925f64ca301", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1720, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f362fac6f29d81b82f2ff9aef0d8f0c7f1b2f18481432f2ff1bef94ff154f957f1c8f0b8f2618144", "baseline_text": "맡겨 둬∈//난 그러려고，//여기 있는 거니까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まかせといてんか！//ウチはそのために、//ここにおるんやさかいな。", "pointer_offset": 756, "unit": "dialogue:98f62eea5766096d", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 2567, "capacity": 70, "raw_hex": "f5c2f16bf1578143f0b1fa82f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0e12f2ff0adf2c3f8b2f0a5f0b1f944f243f1c781432f2ff16bf1a9f9a9f484f8c8f0c5f2eafa57f94af154f15a81b8", "baseline_text": "쌍무는，나랑 오오가미 씨의//마음이 하나가 되면，//무한한 힘을 발휘할 수 있어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "双武は、ウチと大神はんの//二人の心がひとつになることで、//無限の力を発揮できる！", "pointer_offset": 760, "unit": "dialogue:eec8633d269f4bb9", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1866, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f8f9f0a6f17df8b2f2c8f160f0a8f1c781432f2ff1cefaaaf25cf2c0f8a4fa57f94af154f15a81b82f2ff9aef2b0f984f154f15a81b8", "baseline_text": "두 사람이 함께라면，//분명 뭐든지 할 수 있어∈//난 믿고 있어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "二人が一緒なら、//きっとなんでもできる！//ウチは信じてる∈", "pointer_offset": 764, "unit": "dialogue:ae306f96f6b601f8", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1925, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0aff0af8143f0d8f27ef0a481442f2ff0b1f0f4f7d12f2ff0b3f0b4f8c8f2b0f984f154f15a8144", "baseline_text": "아아，그렇지．//나도…//홍란을 믿고 있어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あぁ、そうだな。//俺も……//紅蘭のことを信じてるよ。", "pointer_offset": 768, "unit": "dialogue:c752bab92c59c1d2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 1978, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f7d1f0d8f27ef8f1f151f0a4f9a9f28df28ef0a32f2ff0d8fa62fa63f0a5f8a4f0ad81442f2ff293f294f0def276f0aff7d1", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨…그렇게 진지한 얼굴로//그런 말 하지 마．//부끄럽잖아…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神はん……そないなこと、//真顔で言わんといてぇな。//照れるやんか……", "pointer_offset": 772, "unit": "dialogue:dc55d7dfb3e22063", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 2049, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0d8f262f14481482f2ff0b2fa62f0b1f0f4f7d12f2ff144f4f6f8f3f273f274f276f0af8148", "baseline_text": "…그런가？//이런 나도…//가끔은 괜찮잖아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……そうかい？//こういう俺も……//たまにはいいだろ？", "pointer_offset": 776, "unit": "dialogue:baffa69f0c682d8b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 2102, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f18ef263f0b2f0a4f7d1f151f3f8f0a381432f2ffab9f1b7f8f3f153f0faf0a8f0b8f261f7d1", "baseline_text": "정말이지…진짜로，//죄 많은 남자라니까…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "もぅ……ホンマに、//罪作りなオトコやわ……", "pointer_offset": 780, "unit": "dialogue:451999bc0eadec4c", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 2650, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f1def0faf94ff263f8b2f1b5f15af291f0f0f0eff7d12f2ff16bfa89f1ccf0b2f0b9f0ef8143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf2478148", "baseline_text": "갑자기 말이 없어졌네요…//무슨 일이에요，오오가미 씨？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "黙り込んでもうて……//どないしたんや、大神はん？", "pointer_offset": 784, "unit": "dialogue:b714dd383cdf6ca8", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 2194, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b8f7d1f0b3f0b4f8b2f8d8f18ef0f4f0a381432f2ff0c6f0f7f94bf1e2f984f154f1f3f8c8f285f0b2f148f7d1", "baseline_text": "아니…홍란이 그 정도로，//생각해 주고 있었을 줄이야…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いや……紅蘭がそこまで、//思ってくれてたなんて……", "pointer_offset": 788, "unit": "dialogue:8c1561a78acd30e0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 2705, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef8f1f0e1f39cf9ccf299f8f4f1b5f276f0af81442f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f8e7f28bf272f957f0a6f17df0f381432f2ff1b7f8c8f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "그렇게 의외일 것도 없잖아．//오오가미 씨를 따르는 사람은，//많을 거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そう意外でもないやろ。//大神はんを慕う人は、//いっぱいおると思うで。", "pointer_offset": 792, "unit": "dialogue:3aecf97156a3673d", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 2314, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f14ef97bf2b881432f2ff0faf0dbf0e9f8c8f144f1d0f0f481432f2ff273f274f8a4f287f0c8f2618148", "baseline_text": "조금 더，//자신감을 가져도，//괜찮지 않을까？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "もうちょっと、//自分に自信をもっても、//ええんとちゃう？", "pointer_offset": 796, "unit": "dialogue:83c9d8b8b5f78032", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0031", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 2371, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f2c9f2e9f15af7d12f2ff271f0f9f8e1f14ff0e2f8b9f293f3a8fa57f94af154f0f4f38481432f2ff3ddf0a2f0a3f8f4f36bf36cf8b6f257f0f181b8", "baseline_text": "알았어…//모두의 기대에 부응할 수 있도록，//앞으로도 열심히 할게∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わかった……//みんなの期待に負けないよう、//これからもがんばるよ！", "pointer_offset": 800, "unit": "dialogue:8ccc4f527371b0aa", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0032", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 2438, "capacity": 74, "raw_hex": "f2abf1628143f0d8fa62f2abf1e7f0d3f944f1acf0f0f7d12f2ff25c8143f26af17cf1b5f15af7d12f2ff0d8f0f18143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f8e1f1cff8f3f152f0b2f0b8f26181b8", "baseline_text": "결국，그런 결론인가 보네…//뭐，상관없어…//그게，오오가미 씨의 좋은 점이니까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "結局、そういう結論かいな……//まあええわ……そこが、//大神はんのええとこやもんな！", "pointer_offset": 804, "unit": "dialogue:c1fdb7b43162b844", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN#0033", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04011.SBN", "offset": 2521, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 808, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
